# Dashboard Pages

This folder contains screenshots of the Power BI dashboard pages developed for the AWARE AI Digital Wellbeing Analysis Platform.

## Dashboard Pages

### 1. Introduction

Provides an overview of the project, its purpose, and the analytical focus.

### 2. Executive Overview

Provides a high-level view of digital usage, screen time, application usage, distraction patterns, keywords, and content categories.

### 3. Distraction Intelligence

Analyzes distraction patterns across time of day, applications, content categories, keywords, and burnout-risk groups.

### 4. Wellbeing & User Insights

Analyzes screen time, user groups, wellbeing indicators, sleep patterns, and wellbeing distribution.

## Dashboard Tool

The dashboard was developed using Microsoft Power BI.
